  58               / An indirect error return is desired by the caller.
  59 007635* 1214  L7635,  TAD L7614       / Load AC from L7614 (the strange constant value of L7752)!!!
  60 007636* 3352          DCA L7752       / Store AC to memory address L7752. Clear AC.
  61 007637* 1642          TAD I SYSIO     / Load the value found at the return address pointer
  62                                       / (which should now be pointing at the caller's
