 161 007720* 7012          RTR             / Rotate AC right twice via L.
 162                                       / making 4 right rotates in total.
 163 007721* 0232          AND C77         / Logically AND AC with the constant 0077.
 164                                       / Lowest 6 bits retained.
 165 007722* 3350          DCA WC          / Store the result in AC to WC.
